MIT License

3DBrailleSignMaker
A modified and expanded derivative work based on previous
open-source projects.

Copyright (c) 2026 Alfredo Costa, Marília Morais Thomazi,
Eduardo Thomazi, Kelen Berra de Mello.

Developed at the Instituto Federal de Educação, Ciência e
Tecnologia do Rio Grande do Sul (IFRS) – Campus Caxias do Sul,
Brazil.

Additional development includes:
- New user interface organization
- Portuguese localization improvements
- Latin alphabet + Braille plate generation
- NFC symbol integration for audio description
- Custom plate sizing system
- Accessibility-focused layout improvements
- Printing parameter refinements
- Institutional visual identity adaptations

Based on previous open-source works.

